            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.23+1KI.7.24+1KI.7.25+1KI.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 7:23-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.2+2CH.4.3+2CH.4.4+2CH.4.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byok 4:2-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyomyo ez'omulinga ezikaba ziri omunju ya MUKAMA, entebe n'etanka ey'omulinga ebikaba biri omunju ya MUKAMA, Abakalidaaya bakabicwacwana, omulinga baagutwara Babbulooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.45"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 7:45",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byok 4:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baatwara enyungu, ebitiyo, makaasi, ediisi ez'okutaho obubbaani, n'ebikwato byona eby'omulinga ebinyakukonyezibwa ha mulimo ogw'omunju ya MUKAMA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "esahaani ez'okuguhiraho omurro n'ebbakuli. Ebintu byona ebyakozirwe omu zaabbu n'omu feeza, akabitwara, oteho ebbakuli entoitotoito n'esafuliya ezeekonyezibwa okutwarraho amanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebintu eby'omulinga omukama Solomooni ebi akaba akozire. Enyomyo ziri ibiri, etanka n'entebe ez'okuta omunju ya MUKAMA, omulinga ogwakozire ebikwato ebi byona, gukahingurana obwingi, gukaba gutarukusobora kulengwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obura obw'enyomyo emu bukaba nibuhika emikono ikumi na munaana, kandi ekaba eroho omutwe gw'omulinga; obura bwagwo emikono esatu; akatimba n'ebisisani eby'enkomamahanga, byona by'omulinga, bikaba biri ha mutwe ogu okugwehinguliriza. Enyomyo eya kabiri, nayo ekaba eroho ebintu nk'ebi, hamu n'akatimba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba Yuda ni batwarwa Babbulooni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engabwa y'abalinzi, ekakwata Seraaya nyakatagara, Zefaania katiikiro we n'abalinzi basatu abaalindaga omulyango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu rubuga, akaihamu omunyoro ow'akaba ali ngabwa y'abasaija abarwani, n'abasaija abandi bataano abakaba bali bahabuzi b'omukama abaasangirwe omu rubuga; omuhandiiki ow'eby'ensita ow'engabwa y'ihe ayasoroozaaga abantu ab'ensi egi; n'abantu nkaaga ha bantu ab'omunsi egi abaasangirwe omu rubuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebuzaradaani engabwa, akabakwata yabatwara mb'omukama wa Babbulooni ow'akaba ali Ribula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunsi Hamasi oku, omukama wa Babbulooni nuho yabateeriire yabaita. Abantu ba Yuda nukwo baihirwe omunsi yabo bati, baazaahisibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaasigaireho nibasingirwa Misiri.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
